Sentryboard

This product is a modified fork of Simple Keyboard
(https://github.com/rkkr/simple-keyboard), which is itself based on the
Android Open Source Project (AOSP) LatinIME keyboard
(https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/inputmethods/LatinIME/).

Both upstream projects are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The full license text is in the LICENSE file. The copyright notices of the
upstream authors and contributors are retained unchanged in the header of
each source file. Modifications made by this fork are described in README.md and recorded
in this repository's commit history.
